   On Windows (PowerShell):
   ```powershell
   New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path (Split-Path -Parent {{ workflows_path }}) | Out-Null; Invoke-WebRequest -Uri {{ fetch_url }} -OutFile {{ workflows_path }}
   ```
